"component failures. The error handling approach employs graceful "
"degradation that continues controller operation while logging "
"communication errors for debugging purposes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/C7_rasp_controller.rst:239
msgid ""
"The error handling strategy prevents single component failures from "
"disrupting the entire controller system. This approach ensures that users"
" retain access to functional controls even when some simulation "
"components experience problems."
msgstr ""

