msgid "Communication Protocol Analysis"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/C7_rasp_controller.rst:243
msgid ""
"The communication protocol between the controller and simulation employs "
"a request-response pattern for state queries and command execution. The "
"protocol design minimizes network overhead while ensuring reliable "
"command delivery and state synchronization."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/C7_rasp_controller.rst:266
msgid ""
